      "example_text": "Input: s = \"leetcodecom\"\nOutput: 9\nExplanation: An optimal solution is to choose \"ete\" for the 1st subsequence and \"cdc\" for the 2nd subsequence.\nThe product of their lengths is: 3 * 3 = 9.",
